---
title: SecureCapita - Registration & Account Verification Flow
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant NG as Angular RegisterComponent
    participant API as UserController (/user)
    participant SVC as UserService
    participant DB as MySQL
    participant MAIL as SMTP Mail
    participant VC as Angular VerifyComponent

    U->>NG: Fill registration form
    NG->>API: POST /user/register
    API->>SVC: createUser(firstName, lastName, email, password)
    SVC->>DB: insert user (enabled = 0)
    SVC->>DB: insert accountverifications (unique URL key)
    SVC->>MAIL: send account verification email<br/>(/user/verify/account/{key})
    API-->>NG: 201 Created (check your email)
    NG-->>U: "Verify your email" message

    U->>MAIL: Open email, click link
    U->>VC: GET /user/verify/account/{key}
    VC->>API: GET /user/verify/account/{key}
    API->>SVC: verifyAccountKey(key)
    SVC->>DB: lookup accountverifications by url
    SVC->>DB: set user.enabled = 1
    API-->>VC: 200 OK (account verified)
    VC-->>U: Redirect to /login
